     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The pharmacy",
     "texto": [
      "**药店** means «pharmacy»; **医院** means «hospital». In Chinese you can describe an ailment with **我头疼** («I have a headache») or say **我不舒服** («I feel unwell»).",
      "To talk about where you buy medicine, use **去药店买药**: first the destination, then the action."
     ],
